{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/881212-solars-demand-a-context-forum-game","id":881212,"title":"SOLARS DEMAND A CONTEXT! (forum game)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Solar Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-05-03T13:21:30-07:00","id":881212,"title":"SOLARS DEMAND A CONTEXT! (forum game)","content":"This is a game where a person writes an out of context quote and the next post gives it a context for the Exalted universe. Now the second post puts up another quote to which a third person will try to place into Creation/Malfeas/the Underworld/Yu Shan/etc and put up yet another quote, and so on so for.<br /> <br /> Example:<br /> Post A: 'To be or not to be - that is the question'<br /> <br /> Post B: A chosen of serenity deciding if a love affair between a noble and a fishmonger should proceed.<br /> 'IF YOU DESTROY THE BRIDGE, YOU'LL NEVER SEE HER AGAIN!'<br /> <br /> Post C: A Solar is being taunted by the Mask of Winters as the former has only one chance to destroy the Death Lord, by using an evocation to incinerate a bridge with both the Exalt's true love and the undead tyrant. And the bridge was built over Oblivion, because Neverborn!<br /> 'I wanted to change the world too, but I changed nothing'<br /> <br /> Some rules before we start:<br /> 1) Quote can be from anywhere; history, fiction or just an old proverb. Just not from Exalted literature or any game of Exalted.<br /> 2) Do not reveal the source of the quote until some has given it context for Exalted by another poster. You may reveal the source at any later date.<br /> 3) The quote must be applicable to the Exalted universe, no terms or place names that do not fit into Creation or are specific to reality/a particular fictional universe; for example both America and Gotham city cannot be used.<br /> 4) Keep it SFW. No explicit quotes or quotes from material intended for mature audiences. So nothing by E. L. James, the Memoirs of Casanova or the like.<br /> <br /> First quote:<br /> 'A homemade Man? I don't understand?'<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://jaxushomebrew.blogspot.ie/2016/06/introduction-site-map-and-catalogue.html\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew blog</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1291-mr-jaxus","name":"Mr.Jaxus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1291_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"379"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-03T13:41:13-07:00","id":881231,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr.Jaxus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/881212-solars-demand-a-context-forum-game#post881212\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">First quote:<br /> 'A homemade Man? I don't understand?'</div> </div> </div> </div>said the Chosen of Serenity. &quot;I have someone wonderful lined up for you! I know you like crafting solutions to all your problems, but just wait a little longer 'til my plans come together. You'll have a better love story then, Twilight.&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Next quote:<br /> &quot;We've had one, yes. What about second breakfast?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Angel Toaster from Keychain of Creation.","edited":{"userid":7935,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7935-cartographer7","user":"Cartographer7","date":". 05-03-2016, 04:58 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7935-cartographer7","name":"Cartographer7","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7935_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"31"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-03T14:05:27-07:00","id":881250,"title":"","content":"<br /> &quot;Second Breakfast...&quot; the Fair Folk repeated. &quot;I am not aware of any 'Second Breakfast'.&quot;<br /> The Eclipse smiled at the Fair Folk. &quot;It's a tradition of my people. One must always have second breakfast before conducting business.&quot;<br /> &quot;I see!&quot; The Fair Folk clapped her hands. &quot;Come! Let us have second breakfast!&quot; Servants streamed out of the hollow in the tree, bearing heavy laden platters of food.<br /> The Eclipse settled back at the dining table. He bought some time for his Night Caste friend. Hopefully it will be enough.<br /> <br /> ((There needs to be a Solar Resistance Charm for devouring large quantities of food in one sitting. Or maybe Occult for turning consumed food into Sorcerous Motes.))<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Next Quote:</b><br /> <br /> \u201cYou\u2019re saying it wrong! It\u2019s Wing-gar-dium Levi-o-sa, make the \u2018gar\u2019 nice and long.\u201d","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 05-03-2016, 05:11 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-03T14:45:47-07:00","id":881274,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar3950_2.gif');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"3950\" data-vbnamecard=\"3950\">wonderandawe</a>, that quote is against rule 3, it's a concept, the spell, that is specific to a particular universe that is not Exalted and thus cannot be used for the game. I'll let it go this once because it is understandable that you misunderstood the rule's full context. It doesn't just cover places, but also objects, people, concepts, spells and unusual phenomena. Now a quote could call some one 'a super man', but the Superman could not be directly referred to.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://jaxushomebrew.blogspot.ie/2016/06/introduction-site-map-and-catalogue.html\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew blog</a>","edited":{"userid":1291,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1291-mr-jaxus","user":"Mr.Jaxus","date":". 05-03-2016, 05:53 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1291-mr-jaxus","name":"Mr.Jaxus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1291_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"379"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-03T14:48:21-07:00","id":881275,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/881212-solars-demand-a-context-forum-game?p=881250#post881250\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">\u201cYou\u2019re saying it wrong! It\u2019s Wing-gar-dium Levi-o-sa, make the \u2018gar\u2019 nice and long.\u201d</div> </div> </div> </div>Said Thousand Screams Rapace to her master, the Mask of Winters. <br /> <br /> &quot;I don't understand!&quot; He cries in return, &quot;such small pictures couldn't possibly convey so many different meanings all at once!&quot;<br /> <br /> Thousand Screams Rapace squeezes the bridge of her nose between two fingers, &quot;alright, we'll try the next page.&quot;<br /> <br /> New Quote:<br /> <br /> &quot;That which I do now, is the greatest thing I have ever done.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>(10chars)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2721-elkovash","name":"Elkovash","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2721_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"528"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-03T14:54:17-07:00","id":881276,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr.Jaxus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/881212-solars-demand-a-context-forum-game?p=881274#post881274\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar3950_2.gif');\" class=\"b-