84013\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">'<span style=\"color:#252525\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">No. To the pain.'</span></span></span></div> </div> </div> </div>The Liminal grinned as his opponent named his terms. &quot;<i>Deal</i>.&quot; Anything he took off, he could just sew back on. He had this contest in the bag.<br /> <br /> -<br /> <br /> &quot;No time to explain, I need to borrow your kitten!&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-06T14:42:48-07:00","id":884084,"title":"","content":"&quot;Last time you borrowed one of my pets you ripped its heart out and ate it!&quot; The Dawn cuddles his kitten close to his chest. <br /> The Lunar sighs. &quot;I won't rip its heart out! Now, give me the kitten!&quot;<br /> &quot;Okay...&quot; The Dawn hands over the kitten.<br /> &quot;Kitty is small enough to eat whole.&quot; The Lunar opens his jaws wide. <br /> <br /> <br /> ---<br /> <br /> \u201cI have a huge and savage conscience that won't let me get away with things.\u201d","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-06T15:46:39-07:00","id":884124,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/881212-solars-demand-a-context-forum-game?p=884084#post884084\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">\u201cI have a huge and savage conscience that won't let me get away with things.\u201d</div> </div> </div> </div>The inmense dawn caste rose from the taverns floor, shadowing over the bandit leader and his henchmen. He passes his hands through his wild hair and beard, trying to bring order to his face. After a quick look at the ones who so rudely awakened him he cracks his fists. His giant muscles flex with each movement, muscles hard as steel and with enough strenght to break boulders.<br /> &quot;It's kind of a problem. You see, I was more than happy to keep sleeping under the table and let you do your thing, but since my conscience won't let me sleep...&quot;<br /> He shrugs, and then smiles.<br /> &quot;Oh well, it's always good to do some exercise in the morning...&quot;<br /> No bandit was killed that day, but the majority of them wished they were dead when he was finished.<br /> <br /> Next:<br /> &quot;Nearly all men can stand adversity, but if you want to test a man's character, give him power.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2964-firanai","name":"Firanai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2964_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"672"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-06T17:03:31-07:00","id":884164,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Firanai</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Next:<br /> &quot;Nearly all men can stand adversity, but if you want to test a man's character, give him power.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>...the Infernal grinned grimly to himself. &quot;And Im a very bad person.&quot; he said as he dipped his hand into the void.<br /> <br /> <br /> &quot;This is no <i>mere</i> mage!&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/697-arteliex","name":"Arteliex","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar697_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"591"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-06T18:20:56-07:00","id":884219,"title":"","content":"&quot;Y'all got that right,&quot; said the swamp urchin Dawn, as she demonstrated on the bandits exactly why they might want to reconsider their life choices. &quot;Right about now, I'm kind of annoyed with y'all. If'n I have ta come back t'give y'all another lesson, I'm goin' be downright upset.&quot;<br /> <br /> --<br /> <br /> &quot;You knew the job was dangerous when you took it, Fred.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1184-ladylens","name":"LadyLens","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1132"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-07T00:20:01-07:00","id":884433,"title":"","content":"Fred looked a Ten Thousand Blossoms as the behemoth rose from it's slumber. She was slightly shaking, he knew that the Eclipse caste had only come along to not look like dead weight. Fred gave a reassuring grin.<br /> 'Don't worry Blossom, We'll be alright' He reassured as the monster turn to face them. Her face slightly contorted with the fear she was trying to hide. Fred simply picked up his grimcleaver, slamming down on the monster. And then there was one less primordial servant in Creation.<br /> <br /> __________________________________________________ __________________________________________________ __________________________________________________ ___________<br /> <br /> ' It awoke. This time, there was no mistake. It is time. As the thunderous vibrations rocked the cave, another creature stirred, and another. Dozens upon hundreds upon thousands. <br /> They shook off their long, deep sleep. Energy poured through them, along with absolute knowledge. Their duty awaited. It was time.'","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://jaxushomebrew.blogspot.ie/2016/06/introduction-site-map-and-catalogue.html\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew blog</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1291-mr-jaxus","name":"Mr.Jaxus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1291_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"379"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-11T17:38:37-07:00","id":888691,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr.Jaxus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/881212-solars-demand-a-context-forum-game?p=884433#post884433\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">' It awoke. This time, there was no mistake. It is time. As the thunderous vibrations rocked the cave, another creature stirred, and another. Dozens upon hundreds upon thousands.<br /> They shook off their long, deep sleep. Energy poured through them, along with absolute knowledge. Their duty awaited. It was time.'</div> </div> </div> </div>The pattern spiders, created so long ago at the behest of Jupiter's inexplicable and absolute foresight, awoke. Iridescent tarsi clasped fate's threads effortlessly, as if they had done it before.<br /> And though a dozen stars had faded just that dawn- the dawn of a horrific Contagion- not one more destiny followed theirs into Saturn's embrace.<br /> -<br /> &quot;We were moving mountains <i>long</i> before we knew we could.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/476-argonometra","name":"Argonometra","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"534"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-12T00:01:22-07:00","id":888907,"title":"","content":"You all insist on such serious contexts...<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Argonometra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/881212-solars-demand-a-context-forum-game?p=888691#post888691\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;We were moving mountains <i>long</i> before we knew we could.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;You've been doing this how long? How many did you already move?&quot;<br /> &quot;A while. A couple years.&quot; Reckless Star lounged against the boulder. &quot;Seven mountains? Eight? Point is, we know what we're doing now. Don't worry.&quot;<br /> Henjanid clutched her hair in frustration. &quot;And you started doing it <b><i>without</i></b> knowing what you were doing!? Where have you been dropping them?&quot;<br /> &quot;Oh... I dunno. After they get above the clouds I can't see where they end up.&quot;<br /> &quot;You don't... they could be landing anywhere, even on top of towns or cities, and you have <i><b>no idea</b></i>?!&quot; Her voice rose in pitch and fury.<br /> &quot;Uh... &quot; The Dawn frowned at his circlemate, trying to think of an answer that wouldn't make the Eclipse angrier.<br /> She pre-empted him by igniting her anima. &quot;No more kicking mountains into the sky!&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> &quot;Where am I? What's happening!? ....... Why are you hitting me?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">She/Her. I am literal-minded and write literally. If I don't say something explicitly, please never assume I implied it. The only exception is if I try to make a joke.</span></span></span></div> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">My point of view may be different from yours but is equally valid.</span></span></span><br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1x1ycoxJF0G9niMt5D3Pp7owZ7tw8AJvL?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted-cWoD-ArM url mega-library</a>. Exalted <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/663334-random-name-generator\" target=\"_blank\">name-generators</a>.","edited":{"userid":896,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/896-erinys","user":"Erinys","date":". 05-12-2016, 12:13 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/896-erinys","name":"Erinys","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar896_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4235"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-12T00:54:52-07:00","id":888932,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Erinys</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/881212-solars-demand-a-context-forum-game?p=888907#post888907\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;Where am I? What's happening!? ....... Why are you hitting me?&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>The Sidereal secret police is a harsh mistress.<br /> -<br /> &quot;I lost my chi! Where's my chi? Have you seen it?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/476-argonometra","name":"Argonometra","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"534"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-06T11:46:56-07:00","id":908476,"title":"","content":"Ten Thousand Blossoms slapped her own face at Copper Brutus' incompetence. <br /> 'You're supposed to be our sorcerer.' Scowled the Eclipse, 'It's not called Chi, it's essen-' *BOOM!*<br /> 'So that's where it!' Replied Copper Brutus as sorcerous essence vaporized the fortress behind them.<br /> <br /> __________________________________________________ __________________________________________________ __________________________________________________ ___________<br /> <br /> 'The Strength of Dragons is in your hair.'","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://jaxushomebrew.blogspot.ie/2016/06/introduction-site-map-and-catalogue.html\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew blog</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1291-mr-jaxus","name":"Mr.Jaxus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1291_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"379"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-06T11:53:25-07:00","id":908480,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr.Jaxus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/881212-solars-demand-a-context-forum-game?p=908476#post908476\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> 'The Strength of Dragons is in your hair.'</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;Seriously? The bottle actually says this?&quot; Your Fire Aspect cousin shakes the bottle of hair dye in her hand.<br /> <br /> You snatch back the bottle. &quot;At this point, I'll try anything to trigger my exaltation.&quot;<br /> <br /> ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br /> <br /> &quot;If I break the glass then I'll have to fly.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-07T05:30:58-07:00","id":909063,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/881212-solars-demand-a-context-forum-game?p=908480#post908480\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;If I break the glass then I'll have to fly.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Said the sorcerer, preparing Stormwind Rider, trapped in a raksha's comically-oversized glass bottle.<br /> <br /> ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;I am vengeance. I am the night! I am--&quot;</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":11538,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11538-kingcrackers","user":"kingcrackers","date":". 06-07-2016, 08:40 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\u