scales are iron.&quot; &quot;my armor is your mother!&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;That's a hurtful thing to say,&quot; said the Lesser Elemental Dragon of lightning, recoiling in horror.<br /> &quot;But factual!&quot; replied the callous Exalt, ready to complete the set.<br /> <br /> ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;Life before death. Strength before weakness. Journey before destination.&quot;</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":11538,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11538-kingcrackers","user":"kingcrackers","date":". 06-07-2016, 09:22 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11538-kingcrackers","name":"kingcrackers","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11538_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"305"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-07T18:44:14-07:00","id":909694,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>kingcrackers</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/881212-solars-demand-a-context-forum-game?p=909670#post909670\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><i>&quot;Life before death. Strength before weakness. Journey before destination.&quot;</i></div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;Hm. A pity. We could have danced together to bring sweet oblivion to all those poor wretches -&quot; The Abyssal deathknight wrenched his grimscythe from the black earth and assumed the third ready position of White Reaper style &quot; - <b>but you shall not keep me from my holy</b> <b>task!</b>&quot;<br /> <br /> The Dawn caste farmgirl braced herself as the monstrous black blade slammed into her own farming scythe, gritting her teeth and channeling her inner strength into the weapon - that was the only thing that kept it from snapping in two.<br /> <br /> -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;While there are many people who see you as heroes, there are some who would prefer the word </i>vigilantes<i>. You have been allowed to operate with </i>unlimited power<i>, and </i>no supervision<i>! That is the something the world <b>can no longer tolerate</b>.&quot;</i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm feeling bluuuueeeee~","edited":{"userid":175,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/175-prometheus878","user":"Prometheus878","date":". 06-07-2016, 10:02 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/175-prometheus878","name":"Prometheus878","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar175_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1477"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-07T19:00:45-07:00","id":909706,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prometheus878</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/881212-solars-demand-a-context-forum-game?p=909694#post909694\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><i>&quot;There are many who look upon you as heroes; but there are some who would prefer the word </i>vigilantes<i>. You have been allowed to operate with </i>unlimited power<i>, and </i>no supervision<i>! That is the something the world <b>can no longer tolerate</b>.&quot;</i></div> </div> </div> </div>The Getimians declaring war on the Sidereals.<br /> -<br /> &quot;<i>Dynamite</i>?! Who has <i>dynamite</i>?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/476-argonometra","name":"Argonometra","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"534"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-08T10:06:56-07:00","id":910154,"title":"","content":"&quot;I got Dynamite, that's who!&quot; The crazed fire aspect cackles as he throws the lit stick down the mine shaft. <br /> <br /> ______________________________<br /> <br /> &quot;So you must carry this light into the darkness<br /> You shall be a star unto the night<br /> You will find hope alive among the hopeless<br /> That is your purpose to this life&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-08T11:45:42-07:00","id":910220,"title":"","content":"Chejop finished his little piece to the child. She only nodded in response, probably scared for her life. She had woken up today being a street rat, and she would be sleeping in a literal heavenly bed that night.<br /> 'I suppose I should introduce myself' Kejop continued, 'I'm a Chejop Kejak, oldest and busiest of the Sidreals, and you are Celestial Ivy, are you not?' the girl nodded again, Kejop gave a small sigh, 'You can talk, and it would be for the best if you did, or people will put words in your mouth and you're work will be far harder.'<br /> __________________________________________________ __________________________________________________ __________________<br /> <br /> 'I'm going to reconquer my teashop'","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://jaxushomebrew.blogspot.ie/2016/06/introduction-site-map-and-catalogue.html\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew blog</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1291-mr-jaxus","name":"Mr.Jaxus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1291_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"379"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-08T11:56:13-07:00","id":910228,"title":"","content":"The old woman picks up her cane and with a twist, reveals a long and thin blade. &quot;It's been decades since I marched with the legions, but I still remember how to wield a sword.&quot; She shows off a few katas before returning her blade to the cane.<br /> <br /> ___________________________<br /> <br /> &quot;Hey, my love, do you believe that we might last a thousand years or more, if not for this?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 06-08-2016, 02:59 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-09T10:16:42-07:00","id":910917,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/881212-solars-demand-a-context-forum-game?p=910228#post910228\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;Hey, my love, do you believe that we might last a thousand years or more, if not for this?&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Ayesha rolls her eyes at Kejak.<br /> &quot;No. You snore.&quot;<br /> -<br /> And, to ramp the difficulty up a notch...<br /> <br /> &quot;Magic bubbles don't just <i>pop</i>. That's why they're <i>magic</i>!&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/476-argonometra","name":"Argonometra","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"534"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-09T13:08:03-07:00","id":911070,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Argonometra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/881212-solars-demand-a-context-forum-game?p=910917#post910917\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;Magic bubbles don't just <i>pop</i>. That's why they're <i>magic</i>!&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>The Chosen of Journeys surveys the damage from the old first age bubble prison. &quot;Then why the fuck did this magic bubble pop?!&quot; <br /> <br /> A smile creeps across the Chosen of Secrets' face &quot;I don't know, but I can't wait to find out.&quot; <br /> <br /> ____________________________<br /> <br /> <br /> &quot;We have followed the sun too long to live only in its shadow.&quot;<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-09T17:06:12-07:00","id":911272,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/881212-solars-demand-a-context-forum-game?p=911070#post911070\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> &quot;We have followed the sun too long to live only in its shadow.&quot;<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;Seriously, <i>just talk to him already</i>. We all like him, we all want to meet him, so just do it!&quot;<br /> <br /> An audible gulp from Saturn followed Venus' outburst, and the Maiden took a moment to master herself. After an eternity of watching and longing, the five sister-avatars approached the impossibly handsome and regal golden figure. The Bringer of Resolution took heart at the Sun's benevolent expression as she presented the lovingly prepared offering on an adamant plate.<br /> <br /> &quot;... W-would you like some cookies?&quot;<br /> <br /> --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br /> <br /> &quot;They <i>were</i> real?&quot; &quot;I used to wonder about that myself. I thought it was a bunch of mumbo jumbo. A magical power holding together good and evil, the dark side and light? The crazy thing is... it's true. <i>All of it.</i> It's all true.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm feeling bluuuueeeee~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/175-prometheus878","name":"Prometheus878","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar175_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1477"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-09T18:00:35-07:00","id":911309,"title":"","content":"The tourist nodded dazedly in response, barely noticing the monk's satisfied smile. Or more lightning blazing into the arena before them, coiling tamely at the feet of the Dragons' newest chosen.<br /> -<br /> Modern Shard time!<br /> <br /> &quot;I don't <i>believe</i> in karma! I just believe in my car.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":476,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/476-argonometra","user":"Argonometra","date":". 06-10-2016, 01:17 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/476-argonometra","name":"Argonometra","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"534"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-10T12:00:34-07:00","id":911806,"title":"","content":"With a crazed smile plastered to her face, the Twilight shifts up and smashes the gas pedal to the floor. The gap widens as the drawbridge raises higher...and higher. <br /> <br /> &quot;I can't watch!&quot; The Night Caste covers his eyes and sinks lower into the seat. <br /> <br /> _________________________<br /> <br /> &quot;As the world comes to an end, I'll be here to hold your hand&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-10T14:08:35-07:00","id":911870,"title":"","content":"The Ascension of Glorious Black Blood raised his hand to his fellow Deathknight. She knock to the side, and before he could react, she embrace him in the coldness of her flesh.<br /> 'I'll stand by you as Oblivion takes us all, I'll never let go' Widow of Forgotten Kingdoms whispered into his ear. 'To all is nothing, I'll whisper sweet nothing to you'<br /> In the darkness of the Underworld, their existences melted into one, Dusk and Midnight caste blended. And as their lips began to reach for the perfect kiss, a sword ran through their body.<br /> 'SCORE!' yelled the Night Caste 'This is worth a thousand roses in Ten Thousand Blossoms Eyes!' The Midnight sighed with disgust, thinking: <i>Not